7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8F%B2%E6%9E%97%E5%A3%AB%E5%A4%9A\" title=\"菲林士多\"><img alt=\"菲林士多\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8F%B2%E6%9E%97%E5%A3%AB%E5%A4%9A\" title=\"菲林士多\">菲林士多</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红尘我为客</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311103</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3111/311103/导演-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">是夜，月色如织，照亮了木隼的眼睛。木隼是墨门的造物，此时正静立于轮椅的椅背之上。<br />此时，竹林中有风疾动，似有狂风席卷之势——是来者不善。她凝神静气，微抬数指，木隼应之而动。一瞬间，夜空被几枚寒芒割破，待定下神时，只能看到木隼的口中衔着数枚银镖。<br />“是我墨门待客不周，有失远迎。”她颔首笑道，轻轻拍手，掌声未定，刹那间，竹林中呼啸之声不绝于耳，无数木隼自枝头跃起，飞向竹林之中某个隐秘的角落。<br />片刻之后，林中传来沉重的坠地声。一只木隼携着略带铁锈味的血气，落在了她的肩膀，将头温驯地贴在了她的颊侧。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Belonging-311104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">天工椅<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Fit for the Gods</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>少见的木制轮椅，来自墨家学派千年传承的技艺。车随意动，如臂使指，兼有飞弩一把，绢布灯笼一盏。<br />有传言说，轮椅中暗藏一百零八种机关，可一人成军，杀人于瞬息。受访者听罢只是大笑离去。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/04/Belonging-311105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">袖里寒芒<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sleeve Needles</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />18<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>大多数时候这些锋芒并不会显露在外，人们只会夸赞她袖边银扣的精致。但若有人因她的羸弱而轻视了她，那么几点流星般的寒芒便会让人知晓她的脾气。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a2/Belonging-311106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">十诫牌<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Ten Tenets of Mozi\" Tiles</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>普通的木质方牌，背面刷有青漆，正面是她一直恪守并宣扬的十条诫训。<br />笔者曾尝试问出其价值，得到的回复却是——“这物上秤不值二两，悬于心上却值千金。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 算尘寰1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B01.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 算尘寰2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%AE%97%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B02.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">算尘寰 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Trapped Trapmaster</small></span></span>"}}